From a72f17e6f90c5ab927e797a3934df2131000f447 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gemini Mainline Experiment <gemini-mainline@example.invalid>
Date: Mon, 31 Aug 2026 01:37:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] regulator: da9213: claim CPU8 before P27 tests

The DA9213 membership integration fixture advances directly from the
published transaction to P27.  CPU8 rollback now requires the public
preflight and claim that the production binder performs first, leaving
the test's otherwise valid P29 proofs unable to retire the transaction.

Follow the production ordering in the hardware-free fixture before
entering P27.  This changes no production path and performs no hardware
or CPU request.
---
 drivers/regulator/da9213-legacy-membership-test.c | 9 +++++++++
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/regulator/da9213-legacy-membership-test.c b/drivers/regulator/da9213-legacy-membership-test.c
--- a/drivers/regulator/da9213-legacy-membership-test.c
+++ b/drivers/regulator/da9213-legacy-membership-test.c
@@ -237,6 +237,15 @@ da9213_membership_seed_p27(struct mt6797_a72_transaction *transaction)
 	ret = mt6797_a72_membership_publish_up(transaction);
 	if (ret)
 		return ret;
+	ret = mt6797_a72_membership_preflight_up(8, CPUHP_ONLINE);
+	if (ret)
+		return ret;
+	ret = mt6797_a72_membership_validate_up(8, 0, CPUHP_ONLINE);
+	if (ret)
+		return ret;
+	ret = mt6797_a72_membership_claim_cpu8(transaction);
+	if (ret)
+		return ret;
 	ret = mt6797_a72_membership_begin_p27_preparation(transaction);
 	if (ret)
 		return ret;
-- 
